<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Josua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Josua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Josua</para>
  <para style="mt">Josua</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s">Josua ye Israel yoba agre i ede pi dumo Kenan edenabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Moses ye Yawe nigl kogonmo yagle moglkwa. Te, Josua, Nun wam moglkwa i, ye Moses ake ple dugwa yagle moglkwa. Ana Moses goglko, Yawe ere mogl, Josua yegl di togwa, <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />Na nigl kogona yagl Moses goglkwa. Yegl pre erme we, ene Israel yoba bogl mudu akie ede pi nigl Jordan koglo ibo pidre, na dumo ta ene Israel yoba teimara i suna enaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JOS 1:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Israel yoba dumo Kenan igwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Ana Josua ere mogl, Yawe okna Moses di tomere dumo Kenan mudu yugwa. Ye dumo Kenan mudu idre, yubu si, Israel yoba yugobuno swara swarade makan tau ye makano aimadi yenabedi togwa. Togo, Israel yoba ye makan nem yoba kuda bogl teigwa i dudugo, ye makano mina kiede meglkwa.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7-8" />Ana Josua ya Israel yoba mudu ere mogl, king mudu nigl Jordan koglo kra ade beimara dumo meglkwa i kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erikwa. King mudu dumo Balgat, dumo kade Lebanon auduno yomara yogwa i, meglkwa ede pi muglo Halak we dimara, dumo Idom yomara magigl yogwa i meglkwa kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erikwa. Yobuglo eriko, Josua dumo mudu i Israel yoba yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i makano aimadi yenabedi yubu si togwa. Ye dumo yubu si togwa i, dumo muglo paimara ya te, muglo kebra kebra ade omara yeigwa i ya te, Nigl Jordan omara dumo auduno yogwa i ya te, muglo meglbi ade umara kra yeimara i ya te, dumo wau yomara ya te, dumo Negev we dimara i yubu si togwa. Dumo mudu i, okna Hit yoba ya Amor yoba ya Kenan yoba ya Peres yoba ya Hivi yoba ya Jebus yoba makano yogwa. Ana Israel yoba king tau kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erikwa i, ye siragl dumo sugl meglkwa kagno magigl i paugwa. <verse eid="JOS 12:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Dumo Jeriko ya dumo Ai, dumo Betel yomara magigl yogwa i, <verse eid="JOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />ya dumo Jerusalem ya dumo Hebron <verse eid="JOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />ya dumo Jarmut ya dumo Lakis <verse eid="JOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />ya dumo Eklon ya dumo Geser <verse eid="JOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />ya dumo Debir ya dumo Geder <verse eid="JOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />ya dumo Horma ya dumo Arat <verse eid="JOS 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />ya dumo Lipna ya dumo Adulam <verse eid="JOS 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />ya dumo Makeda ya dumo Betel <verse eid="JOS 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />ya dumo Tapua ya dumo Hefer <verse eid="JOS 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />ya dumo Afek ya dumo Lasaron <verse eid="JOS 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />ya dumo Madon ya dumo Hasor <verse eid="JOS 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />ya dumo Simronmeron ya dumo Aksap <verse eid="JOS 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />ya dumo Tanak ya dumo Megido <verse eid="JOS 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />ya dumo Kedes ya dumo Jokneam, dumo Karmel we dimara suna yogwa i, <verse eid="JOS 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />ya dumo Dor, dumo Napat Dor suna yogwa i, ya dumo Goim, dumo Gilgal yomara magigl yogwa i, <verse eid="JOS 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />ya dumo Tirsa. King i mudu i swara ede 31-pela meglkwa.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Ana Josua yoba mudu yegl di togwa, Yawe, nono Israel yoba Godno moglkwa i, yegl dugwa, Okna ibo ene kowano awano nigl Yufretis koglo ibo kra moglsre, god kibi kagno kade teigwa. Yegl eriko, yagl ta Tera we digwa, Abraham ya Nahor neno moglkwa i, ama yegl erukwa. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Yegl eruko, na ene kowano awano Abraham nigl Yufretis koglo ibo moglkwa i, agre i ede u dumo Kenan udre, dumo Kenan suna i auro i pi dumo ta ede, dumo ta ede, yegl erika. Yegl ersre, na yagl gak ta teiga, kagie Aisak we dugwa. Aisak tedre, Abraham gawama mere kide moraiglmedi ere edie di, Yawe yegl dume dugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Tribal borders" file="Map_Israel tribal borders_Kuman.jpg" size="span" copy="FMOsoft" ref="24.3" /><verse eid="JOS 24:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>